        <body>
            <div xml:id="d503">

                <pb facs="0462" n="346" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg346"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.00/561.]</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1912-04-20">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 20, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Foreign Office informs me that reports have been received that Desiderio
                    Arias has left Haiti with reenforcements for the revolutionists of Sosua. The
                    Government urgently needs a gunboat and earnestly requests that you pass upon
                    the matter at once.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
